            "start_line": 25,
            "end_line": 33,
            "line_count": 9,
            "preview": "// Override Value: ignores the property \"\", merge=true, all allow flags false. LinkedHashSet<String> ignoredProperties = new LinkedHashSet<String>(); ignoredProperties.add(\"\");"
